UID:fKWLyilssO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nIn an afterlife where souls have
  one week to decide where to spend eternity\, Joan must choose between the
  man she spent her life with and her first love.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/c
 inema/in-theaters/eternity\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mountains on Stage - Winter 2025
DTSTART:20251211T030000Z
DTEND:20251211T061500Z
DTSTAMP:20251211T030000Z
UID:kfwPZ1m0FN
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 180 mins (3h00m)\n\nPresented by Mountains on Stage.
  Mountains on Stage aims to bring the mountains to the city\, to share the
  beauty of mountain sports! A selection of the best documentaries on mount
 ain activities are presented. Read more.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in
 -theaters/mountains-on-stage-winter-2025\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
