UID:voucUUaAeJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 135 mins (2h15m)\n\nStellan Skarsgård and Renate Re
 insve lead an incomparable cast in Joachim Trier’s moving drama about a 
 director’s bid to revive his career and repair his family’s broken bon
 ds.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/sentimental-value\n\nEstima
 ted start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
